:: StoryTitle
Take Your Medicine

:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "C1A2B3D4-3333-4A33-8333-A00000000003",
  "format": "SugarCube",
  "format-version": "2.30.0",
  "start": "Start",
  "zoom": 1
}

:: Start [nobr]
<div class="phone">
  <div class="header"><span>Take Your Medicine</span></div>
  <h1>One small daily habit</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Taking your blood pressure medicine every day is the single most helpful
    thing you can do to keep your pressure under control.
  </p>
  <div class="primary-cta">
    <<button "Next">>
      <<goto "Why">>
    <</button>>
  </div>
</div>

:: Why [nobr]
<div class="phone">
  <div class="header"><span>Take Your Medicine</span></div>
  <p class="lead">
    These medicines work quietly in the background. You may not feel a
    difference day to day, but they are protecting your heart, brain, and
    kidneys over time.
  </p>
  <p class="lead">
    The goal is honest, steady tracking. If you miss a day, you simply pick up
    again the next.
  </p>
  <div class="primary-cta">
    <<button "Next">>
      <<goto "Play">>
    <</button>>
  </div>
</div>

:: Play [nobr]
<div class="phone">
  <div class="header"><span>Take Your Medicine</span></div>
  <h1>How to play</h1>
  <p class="lead">💊 <b>Mark your pill</b> — tap when you take today's dose.</p>
  <p class="lead">🤝 <b>Caregiver help</b> — a helper can mark it with you.</p>
  <p class="lead">🗓️ <b>Build the path</b> — each day adds a step forward.</p>
  <p class="lead"><i>Each day you mark your medicine and your path grows. A gentle celebration plays when the week is complete.</i></p>
  <div class="primary-cta">
    <<button "See the games">>
      <<run
        try {
          if (window.FlutterBridge && window.FlutterBridge.postMessage) {
            window.FlutterBridge.postMessage(JSON.stringify({ type: "CCQ_OPEN_GAMES" }));
          }
        } catch (e) {}
      >>
    <</button>>
  </div>
</div>
